<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34870" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pĕr-ĕquĭto</span></b> ,
			āvi, ātum, 1, v. n.
		and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a.</i>, <i>to ride through</i>, <i>ride hither
				and thither</i>, <i>ride about; to drive
			about</i> (class. but not in Cic.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter duas acies perequitans,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. C. 1, 46</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">longe ex viā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					23, 47</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per omnes partes,</span>”
				<i>to drive about</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. G. 4, 33</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<i>Act.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aciem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 5,
					28</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puer delphino maria perequitans,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					9, 8, 8, § 27</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
